---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import ProductWindow from "../components/ProductWindow.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Bitlab — A simple, fast AI workspace powered by Pi" description="Bitlab is a simple, fast AI workspace powered by the Pi agent runtime for Desktop, WebUI, and CLI.">
  <section class="shell hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Powered by Pi agent</div>
        <h1>Simple. Fast. Ready to work.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Bitlab puts the lightweight Pi agent runtime into a focused workspace that feels quick, clear, and easy to use.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/limboinf/bitlab-agent/releases/latest">Download Bitlab</a>
          <a class="button button-quiet" href="https://github.com/limboinf/bitlab-agent">View source ↗</a>
        </div>
        <p class="hero-note">Desktop · WebUI · CLI &nbsp; / &nbsp; Open source under Apache-2.0</p>
      </div>
      <ProductWindow />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section" id="features">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2>Less ceremony.<br />More useful work.</h2>
      <p class="section-intro">Pi handles the agent loop. Bitlab gives it a calm home for sessions, files, tools, and the context you want to keep.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-list">
      <article class="feature"><span class="feature-index">01</span><h3>Pi-powered at the core</h3><p>Bitlab is built on Pi, a minimal agent runtime designed to stay adaptable instead of getting in your way.</p></article>
      <article class="feature"><span class="feature-index">02</span><h3>Focused by design</h3><p>Persistent workspaces, clear permissions, and the tools you need — without a crowded control panel.</p></article>
      <article class="feature"><span class="feature-index">03</span><h3>Fast feedback</h3><p>Short paths from intent to action keep the interface responsive and the work moving.</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell section" id="principles">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="manifesto"><p>Good agent software should get out of the way quickly — then remember where you left off.</p></div>
      <div class="principles">
        <div class="principle"><b>01</b><span>Pi keeps the agent loop small and adaptable.</span></div>
        <div class="principle"><b>02</b><span>Clear surfaces make powerful tools easier to use.</span></div>
        <div class="principle"><b>03</b><span>Persistent context means less setup, every time.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="download">
    <div class="shell">
      <div class="eyebrow">Ready when you are</div>
      <h2>Start with a faster path to useful work.</h2>
      <p>Download the latest release, or explore the source behind Bitlab and its Pi-powered runtime.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/limboinf/bitlab-agent/releases/latest">Get the latest release</a>
        <a class="button button-quiet" href="https://github.com/limboinf/bitlab-agent/blob/main/docs/README.md">Read the docs ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
